{"chapter":"c2-01-zeitformen-der-verben","level":"C2","number":1,"title":"Zeitformen der Verben","rows":[{"section":"story","type":"story-line","idx":1,"text":"Hör mal ich lese dir den Anfang vor","speaker":"Constanze","voiceRole":"female","control":"button.story-play-line","chapter":"c2-01-zeitformen-der-verben","level":"C2"},{"section":"story","type":"story-line","idx":2,"text":"Gern","speaker":"Timo","voiceRole":"male","control":"button.story-play-line","chapter":"c2-01-zeitformen-der-verben","level":"C2"},{"section":"story","type":"story-line","idx":3,"text":"Es ist Sommer 1989 Die Stadt schweigt Ein Mann geht durch die leere Straße","speaker":"Constanze","voiceRole":"female","control":"button.story-play-line","chapter":"c2-01-zeitformen-der-verben","level":"C2"},{"section":"story","type":"story-line","idx":4,"text":"Warum erzählst du das im Präsens","speaker":"Timo","voiceRole":"male","control":"button.story-play-line","chapter":"c2-01-zeitformen-der-verben","level":"C2"},{"section":"story","type":"story-line","idx":5,"text":"Das historische Präsens macht die Erzählung lebendig","speaker":"Constanze","voiceRole":"female","control":"button.story-play-line","chapter":"c2-01-zeitformen-der-verben","level":"C2"},{"section":"story","type":"story-line","idx":6,"text":"Aus welcher Perspektive erzählst du","speaker":"Timo","voiceRole":"male","control":"button.story-play-line","chapter":"c2-01-zeitformen-der-verben","level":"C2"},{"section":"story","type":"story-line","idx":7,"text":"Aus der Perspektive des Mannes Nur so bleibt die Vermutung bestehen","speaker":"Constanze","voiceRole":"female","control":"button.story-play-line","chapter":"c2-01-zeitformen-der-verben","level":"C2"},{"section":"story","type":"story-line","idx":8,"text":"Das klingt wirklich lebendig","speaker":"Timo","voiceRole":"male","control":"button.story-play-line","chapter":"c2-01-zeitformen-der-verben","level":"C2"},{"section":"vocabulary","type":"vocab-headword","idx":1,"text":"das Historische Präsens","voiceRole":"female","pos":"noun (fixed grammatical term)","gender":"n","control":"button.vword-voice[data-g=female]","chapter":"c2-01-zeitformen-der-verben","level":"C2"},{"section":"vocabulary","type":"vocab-headword","idx":1,"text":"das Historische Präsens","voiceRole":"male","pos":"noun (fixed grammatical term)","gender":"n","control":"button.vword-voice[data-g=male]","chapter":"c2-01-zeitformen-der-verben","level":"C2"},{"section":"vocabulary","type":"vocab-headword","idx":2,"text":"die Vermutung","voiceRole":"female","pos":"noun","gender":"f","control":"button.vword-voice[data-g=female]","chapter":"c2-01-zeitformen-der-verben","level":"C2"},{"section":"vocabulary","type":"vocab-headword","idx":2,"text":"die Vermutung","voiceRole":"male","pos":"noun","gender":"f","control":"button.vword-voice[data-g=male]","chapter":"c2-01-zeitformen-der-verben","level":"C2"},{"section":"vocabulary","type":"vocab-headword","idx":3,"text":"die Perspektive","voiceRole":"female","pos":"noun","gender":"f","control":"button.vword-voice[data-g=female]","chapter":"c2-01-zeitformen-der-verben","level":"C2"},{"section":"vocabulary","type":"vocab-headword","idx":3,"text":"die Perspektive","voiceRole":"male","pos":"noun","gender":"f","control":"button.vword-voice[data-g=male]","chapter":"c2-01-zeitformen-der-verben","level":"C2"},{"section":"vocabulary","type":"vocab-headword","idx":4,"text":"die Erzählung","voiceRole":"female","pos":"noun","gender":"f","control":"button.vword-voice[data-g=female]","chapter":"c2-01-zeitformen-der-verben","level":"C2"},{"section":"vocabulary","type":"vocab-headword","idx":4,"text":"die Erzählung","voiceRole":"male","pos":"noun","gender":"f","control":"button.vword-voice[data-g=male]","chapter":"c2-01-zeitformen-der-verben","level":"C2"},{"section":"vocabulary","type":"vocab-headword","idx":5,"text":"lebendig","voiceRole":"female","pos":"adjective","control":"button.vword-voice[data-g=female]","chapter":"c2-01-zeitformen-der-verben","level":"C2"},{"section":"vocabulary","type":"vocab-headword","idx":5,"text":"lebendig","voiceRole":"male","pos":"adjective","control":"button.vword-voice[data-g=male]","chapter":"c2-01-zeitformen-der-verben","level":"C2"},{"section":"reading","type":"reading-passage","idx":1,"text":"Es ist kurz nach neunzehn Uhr als ein Politbüromitglied sich verspricht Von diesem Moment an erzählt dieser Essay die Ereignisse im Präsens Tausende strömen noch in derselben Nacht zu den Grenzübergängen Was damals wie ein Missverständnis wirkte gilt heute als einer der folgenreichsten Versprecher der Geschichte","authoredText":"Es ist kurz nach neunzehn Uhr, als ein Politbüromitglied sich verspricht. Von diesem Moment an erzählt dieser Essay die Ereignisse im Präsens. Tausende strömen noch in derselben Nacht zu den Grenzübergängen. Was damals wie ein Missverständnis wirkte, gilt heute als einer der folgenreichsten Versprecher der Geschichte.","voiceRole":"narrator-female","title":"Essay: Die Nacht, in der die Mauer fiel","control":"button \"Listen to passage\"","chapter":"c2-01-zeitformen-der-verben","level":"C2"},{"section":"listening","type":"listening-sentence","idx":1,"text":"Constanze, im Kommentar zum Wendejahr springst du ständig zwischen Präteritum und Präsens.","speaker":"Timo","voiceRole":"male","authoredLineId":"C2_001_L001","control":"button.audio-play-btn (sequence)","chapter":"c2-01-zeitformen-der-verben","level":"C2"},{"section":"listening","type":"listening-sentence","idx":2,"text":"Bewusst — sobald die Zeitzeugin spricht, wechsle ich ins Präsens, damit ihre Erinnerung lebendig wirkt.","speaker":"Constanze","voiceRole":"female","authoredLineId":"C2_001_L002","control":"button.audio-play-btn (sequence)","chapter":"c2-01-zeitformen-der-verben","level":"C2"},{"section":"listening","type":"listening-sentence","idx":3,"text":"Und danach fällst du wieder zurück ins Präteritum für die reine Chronologie?","speaker":"Timo","voiceRole":"male","authoredLineId":"C2_001_L003","control":"button.audio-play-btn (sequence)","chapter":"c2-01-zeitformen-der-verben","level":"C2"},{"section":"listening","type":"listening-sentence","idx":4,"text":"Genau, so bleibt klar, was Erinnerung ist und was gesicherte Abfolge.","speaker":"Constanze","voiceRole":"female","authoredLineId":"C2_001_L004","control":"button.audio-play-btn (sequence)","chapter":"c2-01-zeitformen-der-verben","level":"C2"},{"chapter":"c2-01-zeitformen-der-verben","level":"C2","section":"listening","type":"listening-authored-line","idx":1,"text":"Constanze, im Kommentar zum Wendejahr springst du ständig zwischen Präteritum und Präsens.","speaker":"Timo","voiceRole":"male","authoredLineId":"C2_001_L001","reachable":false},{"chapter":"c2-01-zeitformen-der-verben","level":"C2","section":"listening","type":"listening-authored-line","idx":2,"text":"Bewusst — sobald die Zeitzeugin spricht, wechsle ich ins Präsens, damit ihre Erinnerung lebendig wirkt.","speaker":"Constanze","voiceRole":"female","authoredLineId":"C2_001_L002","reachable":false},{"chapter":"c2-01-zeitformen-der-verben","level":"C2","section":"listening","type":"listening-authored-line","idx":3,"text":"Und danach fällst du wieder zurück ins Präteritum für die reine Chronologie?","speaker":"Timo","voiceRole":"male","authoredLineId":"C2_001_L003","reachable":false},{"chapter":"c2-01-zeitformen-der-verben","level":"C2","section":"listening","type":"listening-authored-line","idx":4,"text":"Genau, so bleibt klar, was Erinnerung ist und was gesicherte Abfolge.","speaker":"Constanze","voiceRole":"female","authoredLineId":"C2_001_L004","reachable":false},{"section":"speaking","type":"speaking-model","idx":1,"text":"Sobald die Zeitzeugin spricht, wechsle ich ins Präsens — das wirkt lebendiger.","voiceRole":"narrator-female","control":"button \"Hear model\"","chapter":"c2-01-zeitformen-der-verben","level":"C2"},{"chapter":"c2-01-zeitformen-der-verben","level":"C2","section":"speaking","type":"speaking-task-prompt","idx":1,"text":"Constanze fragt, warum du im K